pre-wrap;">&ldquo;GOLF HILLS,&rdquo;</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> dropping </span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">December 18</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">. He recruits fellow artists, </span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">YN &amp; Lipha Lipha</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, positioned as a December jam made for the streets, the clubs, and the festive season, </span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">GOLF HILLS</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> is an energetic Afrobeat record packed with infectious melodies and vibey, feel-good lyrics.</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Following the buzz generated by his first single of the year </span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&ldquo;AURA,&rdquo;</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> Grovvyt returns with renewed confidence and sonic clarity. </span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">GOLF HILLS</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> introduces a sound widely described as </span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Ghana Dance Music,</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> a vibrant fusion of </span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">hiplife roots and contemporary dance music elements</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, crafted to move both the body and the culture.</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Built on rhythmic percussion, catchy hooks, and an undeniable groove, </span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">GOLF HILLS</span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> captures the celebratory spirit of December in Ghana, blending modern Afrobeat sensibilities with nostalgic local influences. It&rsquo;s a record designed for repeat plays, late-night drives, party speakers, and dancefloors across Ghana and beyond.</span></span></p>12:T38e2,<p id="docs-internal-guid-2ce84ea6-7fff-f69b-513e-6fff15c866ff" dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Accra, Ghana</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> - The journey of "a woman becoming" is now fully realized in sound. Dove Nicol, the compelling Sierra Leonean-born, Ghana-based artist, has officially released her debut self-titled EP, &ldquo;Dove Nicol.&rdquo;</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Available now across all streaming platforms, the EP is a thoughtful, significant soundscape built around themes of identity, duality, self-discovery, and spiritual evolution. Far from standard romantic narratives, Dove Nicol offers listeners a nuanced exploration of personal growth and the complexities of becoming.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Seamlessly blending the soulful depth of </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">R&amp;B</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> with the vibrant rhythms of </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Afrofusion</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, the EP establishes Dove Nicol as a unique voice capable of bridging continents and genres.</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The project features seven carefully crafted tracks&mdash;</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">"</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Ordinary</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Water</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Reckless</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Sky</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Higher</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">396</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, and </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Love Back"</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&mdash;each contributing to what the artist describes as a sonic universe where healing and power coexist.</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><iframe style="border-radius: 12px;" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/album/0YcPsqbCp8kcJo2zzwpIJQ?utm_source=generator" width="100%" height="352" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" loading="lazy" data-testid="embed-iframe"></iframe></span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The core of the project explores </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">self-discovery and spiritual evolution</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, positioning the artist as one unafraid to embrace both her </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">"softness and fire."</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> The tracks craft a sophisticated sonic space where healing, vulnerability, and power coexist and define a new kind of strength.</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">"<em>This project is about honouring all parts of who I am. It's about the journey of self-discovery and spiritual evolution, and understanding that transformation doesn't mean choosing between contradictions, but for me, it means embracing them,</em>" Dove Nicol explains.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">For fans of cross-continental R&amp;B and innovative African music, Dove Nicol's debut is a must-listen. With its blend of cross-cultural sounds and powerful personal narrative, the </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">"Dove Nicol" EP</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #0e101a; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> is a definitive introduction to an artist ready to claim her space on the global stage.</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">FOLLOW DOVE NICOL</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 9pt; margin-bottom: 9pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&bull;</span><span style="color: #e67e23;"><a style="text-decoration: none; color: #e67e23;" href="https://www.instagram.com/iamdovenicol/"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Instagram</span></a></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> &bull;</span><a style="text-decoration: none;" href="https://www.youtube.com/@dovenicol"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #e67e23; text-decoration: underline;">YouTube</span></span></a><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> &bull;</span><a style="text-decoration: none;" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@iamdovenicol"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #e67e23; text-decoration: underline;">Tiktok</span></span></a></span></p>13:T24dc,<p id="docs-internal-guid-bf7706e9-7fff-d8ec-dd39-a9068d05cf47" dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Rising Nigerian artist </span><span style="color: #e67e23;"><a style="text-decoration: none; color: #e67e23;" href="https://www.instagram.com/theonly_cooljb/"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Cool JB</span></a></span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> has officially unveiled his new full-length album, UNIVERSE &mdash; a genre-blending Afrofusion project where street reality meets spiritual reflection. The album expands Cool JB&rsquo;s artistic universe with a sound that fuses contemporary African rhythms, Yoruba storytelling, and emotionally grounded songwriting.</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Crafted for both mainstream listeners and culture-driven audiences, UNIVERSE explores a wide spectrum of human experience: love, betrayal, toxic friendships, divine intervention, ambition, financial struggle, and emotional survival. The album strikes a thoughtful balance between commercial appeal and introspective depth, making it suitable for radio, playlists, and visual storytelling.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">The project features standout records including &ldquo;Toxic Relationship,&rdquo; &ldquo;HAPPINESS,&rdquo; &ldquo;KAKU,&rdquo; &ldquo;MY TIME,&rdquo; and &ldquo;CHOCHOCHO,&rdquo; all built with infectious hooks and street-born energy poised for crossover success. Meanwhile, tracks like &ldquo;GOD IS ABLE,&rdquo; &ldquo;FEARS,&rdquo; &ldquo;WABILAHI TAOFEEQ,&rdquo; and &ldquo;LOVE IN SAPA&rdquo; lean into spiritual resonance and emotional vulnerability, showcasing Cool JB&rsquo;s ability to connect beyond the surface.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Written in a mix of English, Yoruba, and Nigerian street slang, the album&rsquo;s authenticity is rooted in lived experience. Cool JB&rsquo;s raw but intentional storytelling brings the themes to life with clarity and cultural weight. UNIVERSE also features key collaborations with rising star Inspiraystonner, whose contributions on &ldquo;SHOULDER,&rdquo; &ldquo;</span><span style="color: #e67e23;"><a style="text-decoration: none; color: #e67e23;" href="https://ghana-plug.com/cool-jb-drops-soulful-new-single-family-matter-featuring-inspiraystonner/"><span style="background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">FAMILY MATTER</span></a></span><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">,&rdquo; and &ldquo;</span><a style="text-decoration: none;" href="https://afrobeatsmagazine.com/cool-jb-and-inspiraystonner-find-love-in-sapa-a-prayer-for-resilience/"><span style="color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #e67e23; text-decoration: underline;">LOVE IN SAPA</span></span></a><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">&rdquo; add emotional texture and dynamic contrast.</span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><iframe style="border-radius: 12px;" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/album/7rPVZ12xp80QN2YLcg0Rfp?utm_source=generator" width="100%" height="352" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" loading="lazy" data-testid="embed-iframe"></iframe></span></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Designed as a journey rather than a playlist, UNIVERSE moves seamlessly from club-ready anthems built for nightlife and social media to deeper, reflective tracks meant for late-night listening. Each song presents a new chapter in Cool JB&rsquo;s evolving narrative of resilience, spiritual grounding, and personal growth.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">With growing streaming traction and increasing attention from tastemakers, Cool JB is positioning himself as a powerful new voice in Afrofusion &mdash; an artist capable of bridging street realism with globally minded sound.</span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">UNIVERSE is now available on all major streaming platforms, with visuals, press materials, and exclusive merchandise accessible via </span><a style="text-decoration: none;" href="http://lukhasstar.com"><span style="color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #e67e23; text-decoration: underline;">Lukhasstar.com</span></span></a></span></p>
<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Follow Cool JB on </span><a style="text-decoration: none;" href="https://www.instagram.com/theonly_cooljb/"><span style="color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #e67e23; text-decoration: underline;">Instagram</span> </span></a><span style="color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">and </span><a style="text-decoration: none;" href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/3HbvN5UhOmlAblfZ2RRm4k"><span style="color: #1155cc; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color: #e67e23; text-decoration: underline;">Spotify</span></span></a></span></p>15:T515d1,<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;">Over the past few years, Ghana&rsquo;s music scene has seen a dynamic shift toward genre-blending, richly textured soundscapes&mdash;and at the centre of this movement is Kkeda, the Ghanaian&ndash;British Afro‑fusion sensation. Born in London to Jamaican&ndash;heritage parents and raised partly in Ghana, she discovered her musical voice through stunning releases like <em>Temper</em>, <em>Blue Jeans</em>, and <em>Hopeless Place</em>, earning her a nomination in 2022 for &ldquo;UK‑Based Uncovered Artist of the Year&rdquo; at the Ghana Music Awards UK</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;">In this candid conversation with Kkeda for Amplify Ghana, she opens up about her journey navigating hiatuses since 2020, what success means to her beyond fame, how she balances evolution with maintaining her core sound and her new single &lsquo;Love Away.&rsquo;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;">As she reemerges with renewed clarity and purpose, this feature takes you into the heart of her artistic vision&mdash;where honesty, consistency, and creative integrity stand at the forefront of everything she creates.</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">First of all, how do we pronounce your name correctly? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Courier New';">It&rsquo;s pronounced K-ee-d-ah </span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">As an artist, how would you define success? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">For me, success as an artist isn&rsquo;t really about being the biggest name out there. It&rsquo;s about making work that feels honest and knowing it connects with people in a real way in real timing with the best team. That understand my vision. So we can all win. With consistency. And a career.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span></span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">You&rsquo;ve taken year-long hiatuses since 2020&mdash;can you tell us more about these breaks? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Since 2020, the breaks weren&rsquo;t really planned they just happened. Part of it was life, part of it was me trying to find the right people who really get me and what I&rsquo;m trying to build. I&rsquo;ve had moments of doubt too, which is normal when you care about your craft. But every time I stepped back, it helped me come back clearer.&nbsp;</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;<img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"></span></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">You have an amazing voice, and your blend of Afrofusion, R&amp;B, and Pop has created a signature sound for you. Do you think artists should constantly evolve with new sounds, or should they focus on perfecting their niche? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Honestly, I feel like it&rsquo;s a mix. You need to have your sound, that thing that makes people go &lsquo;yeah, that&rsquo;s definitely &ldquo;Kkeda&rdquo;&rsquo;but at the same time,we grow. And when you grow, your sound changes too, naturally and authentically. I don&rsquo;t believe in forcing growth or evolution, but I also don&rsquo;t believe in staying stuck just because something worked once. So, I just go with what feels real at the time. As long as the core of it still feels like me, I&rsquo;m great!</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">Tell us about Love Away&mdash;what inspired the song? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&lsquo;Love Away&rsquo; was inspired by that feeling of giving love and not getting it back the same way. I was in a space where I felt drained, and the song just came out of that. </span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">If you weren&rsquo;t performing as an artist but were solely a songwriter, which artist do you think would deliver Love Away best? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Definitely Ayra Starr. That&rsquo;s my girl she&rsquo;d body it for sure. She has that softness but still sounds strong, and that&rsquo;s the exact energy &lsquo;Love Away&rsquo; carries. But also, Simi. She has that pure, emotional tone and melody that would carry the song beautifully.</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;"><iframe style="border-radius: 12px;" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/track/29zsdVJzzVg2IfgZFqxFoq?utm_source=generator" width="100%" height="352" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen" loading="lazy" data-testid="embed-iframe"></iframe></span></span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">Which artists would you say have influenced your sound and journey as an artist? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">This question always catches me off guard because I pull inspiration from so many artists depending on my mood. Sometimes it&rsquo;s Simi, Beyonc&eacute;, Rihanna, Jhene Aiko, and Tiwa Savage too. Tiwa&rsquo;s energy and vibe really inspires me, especially how she blends Afrobeat with R&amp;B. They all bring out different parts of my sound. I&rsquo;m just learning to trust my own flavor and bring all that into the mix too.</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;"><span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">Your parents are of Jamaican descent, and you&rsquo;ve spent significant time in both the UK and Ghana. How does culture shape your music? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Honestly, it&rsquo;s kind of confusing moving between Ghana, the UK, and having Jamaican roots like that, but I&rsquo;m grateful for it. It&rsquo;s really about finding the right balance. All those cultures mix inside me and my music, giving me a perspective and sound I wouldn&rsquo;t have if I&rsquo;d grown up in just one place. </span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">On Love Away, is there a particular lyric that was inspired by a memorable moment? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Yeah, the line &lsquo;Baby, we have to just stop this&rsquo; came from a moment when I realized things weren&rsquo;t working, no matter how much love I gave. It was that point where I had to be real with myself and say, &lsquo;this isn&rsquo;t healthy anymore.&rsquo; </span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">How does it feel to reintroduce your artistry to the world after nearly a year away? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">It&rsquo;s not really a reintroduction, more like a reinvention a new version of me that I hope people will vibe with and accept. I&rsquo;ve grown, changed, and I&rsquo;m bringing all of that energy into my music now. A more confident and consistent Kkeda.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp; </span></span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">What message do you hope your music conveys to the African diaspora and the global audience at large? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">I want my music to talk about what people in the African diaspora really go through the struggles, the love, the dreams, and even the fantasies. It&rsquo;s about everything we feel and experience, the real and the hopeful. I want people to listen, relate, and feel like they&rsquo;re understood.<span style="mso-spacerun: yes;">&nbsp;</span></span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">Before you disappear on us again for another year&mdash;should we be expecting an album soon? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">I never really disappeared&mdash;life just happened. But good things were happening behind the scenes, and now I&rsquo;m ready to show it. </span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">&nbsp;</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; color: black; font-size: 12pt;">Finally, what&rsquo;s next for you as an artist? </span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><em><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;">Honestly, expect the unexpected but at the same time, I&rsquo;ve been doing this for a while, so maybe it&rsquo;s kind of expected by now. I&rsquo;m just gonna keep doing me and letting the music speak for itself.&nbsp;</span></em></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 12pt;">Interviewed by <span style="color: #e67e23;"><a style="color: #e67e23;" href="https://x.com/appreyyy">Kwaw Blay Apprey</a></span></span></strong></p>b:[["$","section",null,{"className":"news-container","id":"news","children":["$","$Lc",null,{"isAllArticlesPage":false,"fetchNewsData":"$Fd","initialNewsArticles":[{"id":"afroson1c-x-arrives-in-accra-showcasing-west-africas-creative-future-with-the-cavemen-highlife-icon-amakye-dede","summary":"AFROSON1C X (AFX), West Africa’s premier platform for music, innovation, and cultural exchange, returns to Accra","timestamp":{"seconds":1766399965,"nanoseconds":160000000,"isoString":"2025-12-22T10:39:25.160Z","milliseconds":1766399965160},"image":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/amplify-ghana.appspot.com/o/article_images%2Fphoto_1_2025-12-22_10-36-55.jpg?alt=media&token=000264a3-23d7-45aa-8079-cf66b8ef237f","content":"$e","title":"AFROSON1C X Arrives in Accra: Showcasing West Africa’s Creative Future with The Cavemen. & Highlife Icon Amakye Dede"},{"id":"-minister-owusua-declares-total-surrender-in-new-worship-anthem","title":" Minister Owusua Declares Total Surrender in New Worship Anthem","content":"$f","summary":"Spirit-filled Ghanaian gospel minstrel Minister Owusua has officially released her highly anticipated new single, “Ye Dan Wo (We Depend On You)”","timestamp":{"seconds":1765988396,"nanoseconds":926000000,"isoString":"2025-12-17T16:19:56.926Z","milliseconds":1765988396926},"image":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/amplify-ghana.appspot.com/o/article_images%2Fphoto_1_2025-12-17_16-15-31.jpg?alt=media&token=35ebc5fa-fd0e-4fe1-b083-f045ead91335"},{"id":"raevin-closes-out-the-year-piano-ii-featuring-rcee-jubed","image":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/amplify-ghana.appspot.com/o/article_images%2Fphoto_1_2025-12-17_15-02-29.jpg?alt=media&token=c8b82c4a-36ed-448d-acef-fe409688f999","timestamp":{"seconds":1765984026,"nanoseconds":276000000,"isoString":"2025-12-17T15:07:06.276Z","milliseconds":1765984026276},"summary":"As the year draws to a close, Ghanaian singer and songwriter “RAEVIN” returns with a powerful reimagining of one of his standout records, titled “PIANO II”","title":"RAEVIN CLOSES OUT THE YEAR 'PIANO II' FEATURING RCEE & JUBED","content":"$10"},{"id":"grovvyt-aims-for-a-december-anthem-with-new-single-golf-hills","title":"Grovvyt Aims for a December Anthem With New Single 'GOLF HILLS'","image":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/amplify-ghana.appspot.com/o/article_images%2Fa.jpg?alt=media&token=dd532635-7bb0-4815-b387-526d67a9342d","content":"$11","summary":"Fast-rising Ghanaian artist Grovvyt is set to close out the year in style with the release of his brand-new single, “GOLF HILLS,” dropping December 18.","timestamp":{"seconds":1765810439,"nanoseconds":488000000,"isoString":"2025-12-15T14:53:59.488Z","milliseconds":1765810439488}},{"id":"dove-nicol-officially-releases-self-titled-debut-ep","content":"$12","timestamp":{"seconds":1765796897,"nanoseconds":547000000,"isoString":"2025-12-15T11:08:17.547Z","milliseconds":1765796897547},"title":"Dove Nicol Officially Releases Self-Titled Debut EP","image":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/amplify-ghana.appspot.com/o/article_images%2Fphoto_1_2025-12-15_11-05-46.jpg?alt=media&token=ad913d51-abf7-4385-8b01-40e8f6c1c14c","summary":"Dove Nicol, the compelling Sierra Leonean-born, Ghana-based artist, has officially released her debut self-titled EP, “Dove Nicol.”\n"},{"id":"cool-jb-drops-highly-anticipated-crossover-project-universe","image":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/amplify-ghana.appspot.com/o/article_images%2FCool%20JB%20Image%20(2).jpg?alt=media&token=ad1f5f07-314e-4127-95d9-16ebb35f68df","content":"$13","summary":"Rising Nigerian artist Cool JB has officially unveiled his new full-length album, UNIVERSE","title"